{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>尖沙咀發生墮樓案。今日（4日）凌晨5時許，警方接報指，一名男子昏迷躺在金巴利道26號和28號之間地面，頭部流血。救護員接報到場，證實男子當場死亡。</p><p>警方經調查後，死者55歲姓黃，初步相信死者從金巴利道26號一棟大廈墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定，墮樓原因仍在待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"遺體由帳篷遮蓋，白布染有血迹。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1149959706526093312461920.jpeg/jY3rLVM6rhptodwKOs4cF_mI7x5vDhFoDGlQIjZpUCI\"/><figcaption>遺體由帳篷遮蓋，白布染有血迹。</figcaption></figure><p>就現場所見，遺體由帳篷遮蓋，白布染有血迹，警員進入大廈調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖現場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1149959718757076992209658.jpeg/XFFeMv7j8uTQtPjIlbrgWAeEe-FqCb48eTocmkM6HJo\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖現場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員進入大廈調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1149959714558447616962034.jpeg/FcIAF4cNRtZCkLKo6d_7tzKZB1JtTxIc-zHEwcExxME\"/><figcaption>警員進入大廈調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1149959710628253696065978.jpeg/4XDVVJ3HkaIL1nAns5sToDkTuxpcsvOHPICeygaAnso\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-03T23:59:21.838444+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}